1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 83rd generation. 105 to ? 2nd son of Qiong (琼). Also known as Ge (阁), Hao (浩) and Mao Sheng (茂生).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Jiang (姜氏). Had 2 sons - Wan (琬) and Zan (瓒).
2 CONT
2 CONT Declined Imperial appointments repeatedly (朝廷屡徵不受). Lived as a recluse (隐居不仕) during the Eastern Han (东汉) period. Died young.
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十三世。公元105 - ？。黄琼之次子, 黄琬之父。又名黄阁, 黄浩。
2 CONT
2 CONT 朝廷屡徵不受, 隐居不仕。生二子, 长琬。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
