1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 80th generation. Approximately 6 - ?. 2nd and youngest son of Ji Zong (季宗).
2 CONT
2 CONT A recluse (隐者) during the reign of Emperor Han Guang Wu (汉光武, 25 - 57) of the Eastern Han (东汉) Dynasty. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Xiang (香).
2 CONT
2 CONT 八十世。约公元6 - 公元?。季宗之次子, 黄香之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 王莽伐汉时 (公元9 - 公元23), 隐居不仕, 汉光武帝建武十五年 (公元39), 赐隐居服。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - According to the website 黄正瑞的博客, there were 3 ancestors, Huang Fu, 黄辅 (approximately 70 BC - 7 AD), Huang Zhong, 黄忠 (approximately 45 BC - ?) and Huang Pei, 黄沛 (approximately 20 BC - ?) who preceded Huang Lu. However, these a
2 CONC ncestors were not recorded in my Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Ju Jia Pu (文明祖家谱). For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have used the record in my Family Genealogy Book. This record is also consistent with the record in Huan
2 CONC g Shi Zong Qin Wang (黄氏宗亲网).
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
