1 NAME HUANG Zong Bo, 宗伯 72A
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 72nd generation. Approximately 345 BC to _____. 3rd son of Lao (老). Also known as Hui (惠) and Jian (健).
2 CONT
2 CONT An Imperial Librarian and Rules Enforcer (内史侯正) of Zhou (周) during the Warring States (战国) period. In 288 BC, when he was already 58 years old, he sensed that the end of the Zhou Dynasty was near. He felt that there would be no fu
2 CONC ture for his descendants in Zhou as it was in danger of being replaced by the Qin State (秦国). Among the warring states, only the Chu State (楚国) could possibly stand up to the Qin State. In view of this, he decided to send his most
2 CONC  capable son, 27-year old Huang Xie (黄歇), to the Chu State.
2 CONT
2 CONT Number of sons is unknown. His most famous son is Huang Xie (黄歇).
2 CONT
2 CONT 七十二世。约公元前345 ---。浩 (老) 之三子, 黄歇之父。东周/战国时期为内史, 封公爵。
2 CONT
2 CONT 宗伯 (惠, 约公元前345 -) 在周为内史, 封公爵。在公元前288年已58岁, 已感到周朝的灭亡已经指日可待, 为了家族的兴旺, 再也不能让后代在周朝发展, 秦朝又是准备取周而代之的敌人, 在各国中只有楚国有希望与秦国对抗, 因此让自己最有才能的孩子27岁的黄歇 (公元前314 - 公元前238) 到楚国发展。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
