1 NAME 典 Diǎn /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN 典 Diǎn
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 NAME HUÁNG Diǎn, 黃典,102,96世
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 702
1 DEAT
2 DATE 780
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 102nd generation. 702 to 780. 2nd son of An (岸). Also known as Yan Lin (延林-字). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Magistrate of Yongzhou (官永州令) during the reign of Tang Dai Zong (唐代宗).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Zhao (赵氏).
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - In the internet source under the name of Huang Yuan Fang (黄元方 - 百度百科), Dian (典) had 4 sons - Ding (顶), Shuo (硕), Ying (颖) and Jie (颉). However, our Family Genealogy Book (文明祖家谱) does not have the names of the 4 sons. Instead,
2 CONC  Gong (恭) was recorded as the son of Dian. For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have adopted the record in our Family Genealogy Book that Dian was the father of Gong.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 102世。公元702 - 公元780。黄岸之次子, 黄恭之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 唐代宗时官为永州令。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妻为赵氏。生子黄恭。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科
