1 NAME 恭 Gōng /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN 恭 Gōng
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 NAME HUÁNG Gōng, 黃恭,103,97世
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 746
1 DEAT
2 DATE 821
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 103rd generation. 746 to 821. Son of Dian (典).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Scholar (进士 - 780) and Head of the Works Department (工部员外) during the Tang (唐) Dynasty. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Chen (陈氏). Had one son, Xiu (琇).
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - In our Family Genealogy Book, Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱), Gong (恭) was recorded as the son of Dian. However, in the internet source under the name of Huang Yuan Fang (黄元方- 百度百科), Gong was recorded as the son of Ding (顶 - 730 
2 CONC to 804) who was the eldest son of Dian. For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have adopted the record in our Family Genealogy Book.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 103世。公元746 - 公元821。黄典之子, 黄琇之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 公元780得进士。唐朝时为工部员外。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妻为陈氏, 生子黄琇。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科
