1 NAME 琇 Xiù /HUÁNG 黃/
2 GIVN 琇 Xiù
2 _MARNM HUÁNG 黃
1 NAME HUÁNG Xiù, 黃琇,104,98世
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 812
1 DEAT
2 DATE 898
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 104th generation. 812 to 898. Son of Gong (恭). Also known as Shang Guan (裳冠-字). 
2 CONT
2 CONT A Scholar (进士 - 838) during the reign of Tang Wen Zong (唐文宗) and headed the Punishments Department (刑部侍郎).
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Lin (林氏) who bore him Tao (韬).
2 CONT
2 CONT NB - In the internet source under the name of Huang Yuan Fang (黄元方 - 百度百科), Xiu (琇) was recorded as the son of Ru Lin (汝霖 - 759 to 836) who was the adopted son of Gong (恭). Ru Lin married Madam Wang (王氏) who bore him Xiu and Fu (福
2 CONC ). However, Ru Lin was not recorded in our Family Genealogy Book (文明祖家谱). According to the Huang Yuan Fang Genealogy, Ru Lin was the eldest son of Gong's 1st cousin, Chang Zong (昌宗). Ru Lin was given to Gong for adoption to contin
2 CONC ue his lineage. For the purpose of my Family Tree here, I have adopted the record of our Family Genealogy Book.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 104 世。公元812 - 公元898。黄恭之子, 黄韬之父。又名裳冠 (字)。
2 CONT
2 CONT 进士(公元838)。唐文宗时期为刑部侍郎。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配林氏, 生一子名黄韬。居广东南雄。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏氏英佐房园趣无号支谱). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科. 
