1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 107th generation. 932 to 1015. 2nd son of Wei Qing (微卿).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Five Dynasties (五朝后期) and early Song (宋初) Dynasty period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Lin (林氏). Had 6 sons - Ping (评), Shuo (说), Rang (讓), De (德), Jie (捷) and Ji (计).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 107世。公元932 - 公元1015。黄微卿之次子, 黄德之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 配林氏, 生六子 - 评, 说, 讓, 德, 捷, 计。
2 CONT
2 CONT
