1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 55th generation. Approximately 775 BC to _____. Son of Shi Mi (世宓).
2 CONT
2 CONT Conferred nobility (封宗世). An Imperial Investigative Clan Official (畿内族正) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Zhan Fu (詹父).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十五世。约公元前775 ---。世宓之子, 詹父之父。东周/春秋时期官宗正, 迁畿内族正 (师)。
