1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1st wife, Madam Mi (Mai Si) (米氏), was the wife of Huang Yuan Shen (黄源深). She bore him 4 sons - Guo Zong (Gwok Zung) (国宗), Guo Tai (Gwok Taai) (国泰), Guo An (Gwok Ngon) (国安) and Guo Bing (Gwok Bing) (国秉). 2nd wife, M
2 CONC adam Lin ( Lam Si) (林氏), bore him 2 sons - Guo Qi (Gwok Hei) (国器) and Guo She (Gwok Se) (国舍). Madam Mi was a highly skilled physician and geomancer. She treated the then Empress Dowager Yang's breast disease successfully and was c
2 CONC onferred the title Yi Ping Bang Xian Fu Ren (一品邦显夫人), the highest rank for a lady.
2 CONT
2 CONT Her tomb is located in Du Ruan (杜阮) and is a protected cultural site.
