1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 52nd generation. Approximately 845/835 BC to _____. Son of Rui Bo (芮伯).
2 CONT
2 CONT Conferred nobility (封大正). Became First Vice Prime Minister (佐丞相) during the Eastern Zhou (东周)/Spring-Autumn (春秋) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Jun Ya (君牙).
2 CONT
2 CONT 五十二世。约公元前845/835 ---。芮伯之子, 君牙之父。东周/春秋时期为大正 (太仆), 迁左丞相。
2 CONT
2 CONT 考父的名称代表成功的, 有才德的男子。 
