1 NOTE {geni:about_me} My sixth younger brother, Tú 圖 Hũ, moved to Gū Göng 古岡 (Gǔgāng), Shïm Chông Chān Wän 深涌滻灣 (Shēnyǒngchǎnwān), Chẽl Lẽin Āi Ngòk 潮連大岳(Cháoliándàyuè).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sì 視 (Shì) and Hëng 聽 (Tīng) moved from Gū Göng 古岡 (Gǔgāng) to various places in Lẽin Tûn 淩村 (Língcūn).
2 CONT
2 CONT Ngũn 言 (Yán) lived in various places in Gū Göng 古岡 (Gǔgāng), Shïm Chông Chān Wän 深涌滻灣 (Shēnyǒngchǎnwān), Chẽl Lẽin Āi Ngòk 潮連大岳(Cháoliándàyuè). 
