1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 48th generation. Approximately 945 BC to _____. 2nd son of Jian Ya (见雅) or Jian Tui (见推).
2 CONT
2 CONT Officer of the Censorate (内史族正). Served in Gunzhou (衮州) during the Western Zhou (西周) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Lv (履).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十八世。约公元前945 ---。见推之子, 履之父。周朝时为内史。
2 CONT
2 CONT 见推次子。可能见推官庶尹, 为司谏, 当时事物繁忙称为国事鞅掌 ：又非常珍惜如马之缨络, 因此取孩子名字为 ： 鞅。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.  黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.  黄正瑞的博客.
