2 CONT 文起 Mũn Hī was our second generation Grand Ancestor. He received the title of Fourteenth Lõng 郎 [Láng]. He was the the fourth son of 謨翁 Mũ Yǔng. He married [in 1201 C.E.] a woman from the Jiü 周 (Zhōu) family. They had four sons, 仲典
2 CONC Jùng Ēin, 仲誥 Jùng Gäo, 仲訓 Jùng Fün, and 仲真 Jùng Jïn. Her tomb was in Höi Yòn Hôk Dū Dēik 開縣鶴子節(Kāixiànhèzǐjié). His second wife was from the Mâ 馬 (Mǎ) family. Her tomb was in Xëin Ùng Xēl Yõn Sän 仙洞小員山 (Xiāndòngxiǎoyuánshān). His 
2 CONC third wife was from the Yẽng 楊 (Yáng) family. Her tomb was in Xēl Yõn Sän 小員山 (Xiǎoyuánshān). [In 1254 C.E.] her grave site was dugged up by grave robbers and the Yẽng 楊 (Yáng) family took possession of the grave site. 文起 Mũn Hī's
2 CONC  tomb was in Lũng Suī Ù 瀧水都 (Lóngshuǐdū).
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?id=33&
2 CONT
2 CONT 二世祖文起翁-- 奉十四郎系谟翁四子，墓在龙水都仙洞，土名紫皮蓢甜水坑横沙村后山金钱形宝字穴辛酉向。娶马氏，续杨氏，墓俱在仙洞小员山寅甲向。先被贼挖废后，又被杨姓叠挖占葬。 生四子：仲真、仲典、仲训、仲诰。 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://bbs.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?id=305&cid=15
2 CONT
2 CONT  生宋寧宗戊午年三月十五日。终咸淳壬申年七月初六日。
