2 CONT 文詵 Mũn Xëin (Wénshēn) was our second generation Grand Older Uncle. He received the title of Eleventh Lõng 郎 [Láng]. He was the the first son of 謨翁 Mũ Yǔng. He married [in 1201 C.E.] a woman from the Jï 朱 (Zhū) family. Her tomb was
2 CONC  in Fāt Jūk Lẽng Bëin Lěng 法竹梁邊嶺 (Fǎzhúliángbiānlǐng).His second wife was from the Jüng 鐘 (Zhōng) clan. His third wife was from the Mâ 馬 (Mǎ) family. Their tombs were in 沖金石焦龍山 (Chōngjīnshíjiāolóngshān). His fourth wife was from t
2 CONC he Võng 黃 (Huáng) family. She gave birth to five sons: 有仁 Yiû Ngĩn, 有義 Yiû Ngì, 有禮 Yiû Lî, 有智 Yiû Jï, and 有信 Yiû Xïn. His tomb was in Lũng Suī Ù 瀧水都 (Lóngshuǐdū). 
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?id=33&
2 CONT
2 CONT 二世祖文诜翁--奉十一郎谟翁长子，墓在泷水都甜水坑横沙村后山金钱形宝字穴辛酉向。娶朱氏，墓在法竹梁地岭南甲庚向。续娶钟氏、马氏，墓俱在冲金石焦龙山。续娶黄氏。生五子：有仁、有义、有礼、有智、有信。（均为黄氏所出） 
