1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 47th generation. Approximately 970 BC to _____. Son of Mao Zi (髦子). Name could be Jian Ya (见雅).
2 CONT
2 CONT A Court Official/Head of Department (尹) during the Western Zhou (西周) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Had 9 sons. One of the sons was Yang (鞅).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十七世。约公元前970 ---。髦子之子, 鞅之父。官庶尹, 为司谏。生九子, 次子鞅。
2 CONT
2 CONT 见推可能是次子, 没有继承权, 希望他通过推荐而任。
2 CONT
