1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 45th generation. Approximately 1020 BC to _____. Son of Zhong Li (中立).
2 CONT
2 CONT Born during the peak of the Zhou Dynasty (周朝). Was given the name by his father, Zhong Li (中立), in the hope that he would rise to success (崛起).
2 CONT
2 CONT Commander of troops stationed at Chengjun (城均制统) and later appointed Headman of a Ward in charge of astrology (历保正) during the Western Zhou (西周) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Mao Zi (髦子).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十五世。约公元前1020 ---。中立之子, 髦子之父。为掌天星的保章正。
2 CONT
2 CONT 周康王统治时期 (公元前1020 - 公元前996), 天下安宁, 民不犯法, 刑措40余年不用, 号称为周朝盛世 ---成康之治。起屈 (约公元前1020) 刚好生在这个时间, 父辈希望他在周朝崛起中有所作为, 故名起屈(崛)。  
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
