1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 42nd generation. Approximately 1095 BC to _____. 2nd son of Yue Xu (约续). Also known as Xue (觷) or Hou (鲎).
2 CONT
2 CONT An Imperial Court Surveillance Official (司隶) during the Shang (商)/Zhou (周) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Wang Suo (王所).
2 CONT
2 CONT 四十二世。约公元前1095 ---。约续之次子, 王所之父。商/周时代为司隶, 以上为商时代。
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄守恭 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
