1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 39th generation. Approximately 1170 BC to _____. Son of Lin Gong (林公).
2 CONT
2 CONT Appointed Chief of the Xin Zhu (新筑) district (present South Wei County, 魏县南, in Hebei, 河北) during the Shang (商) Dynasty.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Fu Tan (父坛).
2 CONT
2 CONT 三十九世。约公元前1170 ---。 林公之子, 父坛之父。商朝时封新筑公。
2 CONT
